## 7. PERSONAL CORNER SECTION (includes Footer/Contact)
Lighter, more personal tone. Dark background `#0C0C0C`, border-top `border-white/10`. Padding: `py-20 sm:py-24 md:py-32 px-5 sm:px-8 md:px-10`.

**Sub-heading label**: "Beyond Engineering & Code" — purple-400, uppercase tracking-widest, text-xs.
**Heading**: `"Personal Corner"` using `.hero-heading` gradient, smaller: `clamp(2rem, 6vw, 80px)`.

Two columns side by side (`grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8 sm:gap-12`), stack on mobile. Each column: `rounded-[36px] bg-[#141414] border border-white/10 p-6 sm:p-8`, `shadow-2xl`.

### Column 1 — Aviation
- Icon: `Plane` (Lucide), cyan accent (`cyan-400/500`)
- Title: "Aviation & HomeA320"
- Subtitle: "Flight Simulation & History"
- Text:

> "I'm drawn to planes and the history of aviation. My grandfather always took me to the VPAF Museum when I was small, where I would watch and climb into fighter jets. I collect 1:400 model planes and read extensively about Vietnamese aviation history. I became so obsessed that I built a budget home cockpit — a DIY A320 — using wood plates, 3D-printed parts, and electronics. I now run HomeA320, renting it out by the hour to fund my other projects. I also go planespotting with my friends during free time."

- **Interactive gallery**: main image `h-[240px] sm:h-[280px]`, 3 thumbnails below. Images:
  1. `personal/aviation/cockpit-build.jpg` — "Assembling DIY A320"
  2. `personal/aviation/cockpit-schematic.jpg` — "Glareshield & Schematics"
  3. `personal/aviation/childhood-plane.jpg` — "Childhood Dream"
- Active thumbnail: `border-cyan-400`, opacity 100, scale-102
- Footer line: "Featured Project: DIY A320 Simulator" / "1:1 Scale Cockpit" (cyan mono)

### Column 2 — Music
- Icon: `Music` (Lucide), purple accent (`purple-400/500`)
- Title: "American Classic Rock"
- Subtitle: "Rock Guitar & Expression"
- Text:

> "I'm a fan of American rock music from the 60s through the early 90s, especially anti-war and counterculture songs. At my 14th birthday, as a high school entrance gift, my parents gave me an old electric guitar, and I practiced a lot. I occasionally perform near Van Mieu Coffee, close to my house, on summer weekends. Favorite songs: 'More Than a Feeling' and 'It's My Life.' Fun fact: the band behind 'More Than a Feeling' had a member who studied electrical engineering and worked on electric guitars and amplifiers."

- Featured image: `personal/music/electric-guitar.jpg`, `h-[240px] sm:h-[280px]`, hover scale-105
- Gradient overlay at bottom: `Volume2` icon + "Favorite: Boston — More Than a Feeling"
- Song badges (pill-shaped): "Electric Guitar", "Anti-War Rock 60s-90s", "Van Mieu Coffee Sessions"
- Footer line: "Sound Inspiration: Bon Jovi & Boston" / "Analog Warmth" (purple mono)

### Footer / Contact Area
Below the 2-column grid, separated by `mt-28 pt-16 border-t border-white/10`, centered.

- Label: "Let's Build Together" (purple-400, uppercase tracking-widest, text-xs)
- Heading: `"Get in Touch"` using `.hero-heading`, `text-3xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl`
- Paragraph: "Open to robotics engineering, embedded hardware systems, research collaborations, or just a chat about aviation and classic rock."
- `ContactButton` with label "Say Hello"
- Social links row: Email (`vuducminh07@gmail.com` with Mail icon), GitHub, LinkedIn — separated by dot separators (`text-white/20`). Hover: text-white transition.
- Copyright: `(c) {year} Minh — Builder & Engineer. Designed with precision.`

---

## REUSABLE COMPONENTS

**ContactButton**: Rounded-full pill button, gradient background `linear-gradient(123deg, #18011F 7%, #B600A8 37%, #7621B0 72%, #BE4C00 100%)`, inner box-shadow `0px 4px 4px rgba(181, 1, 167, 0.25), 4px 4px 12px #7721B1 inset`, white 2px outline with -3px offset. Text: white, font-medium, uppercase, tracking-widest. Sizes: `px-8 py-3 sm:px-10 sm:py-3.5 md:px-12 md:py-4`, `text-xs sm:text-sm md:text-base`. Accepts optional `label` prop (default: "Contact Me").

**LiveProjectButton**: Ghost/outline pill button. `rounded-full`, `border-2 border-[#D7E2EA]`, text color `#D7E2EA`, font-medium, uppercase, tracking-widest. Sizes: `px-8 py-3 sm:px-10 sm:py-3.5`, `text-sm sm:text-base`. Hover: `bg-[#D7E2EA]/10`. Accepts `onClick` handler and optional `label` prop (default: "Read More").

**FadeIn**: Framer Motion wrapper using `whileInView` with `viewport={{ once: true, margin: "50px", amount: 0 }}`. Accepts `delay`, `duration` (default 0.7), `x` (default 0), `y` (default 30), `className`. Easing: `[0.25, 0.1, 0.25, 1]`. Uses `motion.create()` for dynamic element types.

**Magnet**: Mouse-following magnetic hover effect. Tracks mouse position relative to element center, applies `translate3d` transform divided by strength factor. Activates when cursor is within padding distance of element edge. Smooth transition in (0.3s ease-out) and out (0.6s ease-in-out). Uses `willChange: 'transform'`.

**AnimatedText**: Character-by-character scroll-reveal text animation. Each character goes from opacity 0.2 to 1 based on its position in the text relative to scroll progress. Uses Framer Motion `useScroll` targeting the paragraph element with offset `['start 0.8', 'end 0.2']`. Each character uses invisible placeholder + absolute positioned animated span.

---

## KEY DEPENDENCIES
- `react`, `react-dom` (^18.3.1)
- `framer-motion` (^12.38.0)
- `lucide-react` (^0.344.0)
- `tailwindcss` (^3.4.1)
- `vite`, `typescript`

## RESPONSIVE BREAKPOINTS
Tailwind's default breakpoints (`sm`: 640px, `md`: 768px, `lg`: 1024px), mobile-first approach. Heavy use of `clamp()` for fluid typography. Design scales gracefully from mobile to ultra-wide screens.

